'''Bozbash''' ({{langx|hy|բոզբաշ}} {{IPA|hy|bozˈbɑʃ||audio=Hy-բոզբաշ.ogg}}; {{langx|az|bozbaş}} {{IPA|az|bozˈbɑʃ||audio=LL-Q9292 (aze)-Zardabi Bakuvi-bozbaş.wav}}; {{langx|fa|آبگوشت بزباش}}) is a traditional meat stew (also described as a soup) that is popular in [[Armenia]], [[Azerbaijan]] and [[Iran]].{{sfn|Ghanoonparvar|1989|page=425}}{{sfn|Bender|2014}}
